{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14220160","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14220160","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1422016001:0":{"text":"대체 라바스한테 무슨 얘기를 한 거야?","source_cn":"你们跟拉瓦斯说什么啦？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE42E7E02D57D61FC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1422016002:0":{"text":"왜? 설마 이상한 짓 한 건 아니지?!","source_cn":"怎么了？他不会想不开出什么事了吧？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFCC595EE1246F7F3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1422016003:1":{"text":"아냐, 아냐. 어제 신나서 돌아오더니 양조기를 꼭 끌어안곤 진짜 양조의 대가는 너라느니 중얼거리더라고...","source_cn":"没有没有，他昨天兴冲冲地回来，抱着他的酿造器一个劲地跟...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA035AC8A481A53B1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1422016004:0":{"text":"그리고 오늘 아침에 양조기를 들쳐메고 어디론가 떠났어! 뭐 가정용 양조기 시장을 개척하겠다나... 세상을 돌아다니면서 홍보를 하겠대!","source_cn":"今天一早他就带着他的酿造器走啦，说他要开拓什么家用酿造...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA8FF8661B01AB301","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1422016005:0":{"text":"내가 파이어 스케일 스페셜을 너무 많이 마신 건 아니겠지... 왜 한 마디도 못 알아 듣겠지?","source_cn":"我不会是火鳞酿喝多了吧……怎么一句话都听不懂呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE3ACDCAB2AABC309","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1422016006:0":{"text":"금방 알게 될 거야! 어쩌면 머지 않아 연회에서 마시는 모든 맥주가 라바스의 양조기로 만든 것일 수도 있겠는데?","source_cn":"很快你就会懂啦！说不定过不了多久，你在宴会上喝到的啤酒...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1A7D27AB8E79ED02","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:矮人吉姆":{"text":"드워프 짐","source":"矮人吉姆","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:祖娅":{"text":"조아","source":"祖娅","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":7,"localized_text_count":6,"speaker_count":2}}